"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這下孟嘗君頭大了，大衣只有一件，已經送給秦昭王，","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"很多故事會寫主角遇到問題、想辦法解決，最後出現結果。把這三個部分找出來，就能掌握故事怎麼發展，也比較容易整理重點。\n讀這類故事時，可以先找出主角，再用三個問題整理：\n❶問題：主角遇到了什麼困難？\n❷解決：誰做了什麼，來解決這個困難？\n❸結果：問題解決後，最後結果如何？\n今天，我們就來學這個超實用的閱讀方法，用「問題、解決、結果」的方式來整理故事內容，幫助你輕鬆抓到重點。舉例來說：","n":191,"ssz":".......1.....................1.1.......................................1....1...........1.......................1...............................1.............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"很多故事會寫主角遇到問題、想辦法解決，最後出現結果。把這三個部分找出來，就能掌握故事怎麼發展，也比較容易整理重點。","n":57,"ssz":".......1.....................1.1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀這類故事時，可以先找出主角，再用三個問題整理：","n":24,"ssz":".............1....1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶問題：主角遇到了什麼困難？","n":14,"ssz":".....1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷解決：誰做了什麼，來解決這個困難？","n":18,"ssz":"..............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸結果：問題解決後，最後結果如何？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今天，我們就來學這個超實用的閱讀方法，用「問題、解決、結果」的方式來整理故事內容，幫助你輕鬆抓到重點。舉例來說：","n":56,"ssz":".........1.............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例一：烏鴉喝水","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"天氣炎熱，烏鴉又渴又累。牠找到一個有水的瓶子，但瓶子太深，水太少，烏鴉喝不到。烏鴉叼來小石頭丟進瓶子，讓水面升高，最後順利喝到水。","n":65,"ssz":"................1....1...1..........1........1...1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑ 與紅色手寫字（圖形），文字流無勾選資訊","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶主角是誰？","n":6,"ssz":"..1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"烏鴉","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷主角遇到了什麼「問題」？","n":13,"ssz":"..1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"喝不到水","n":4,"ssz":".1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"天氣炎熱","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸問題如何「解決」？","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"叼小石頭丟進瓶子裡，讓水面升高","n":15,"ssz":"...1...1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹最後得到什麼「結果」？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主角順利喝到水","n":7,"ssz":".1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主角沒有喝到水","n":7,"ssz":".1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文的「雞鳴」故事","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接下來，我們來看課文的「雞鳴」的故事","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孟嘗君連夜逃到函谷關，但天沒亮，城門不能開。當時規定要聽到雞鳴，士兵才會開門。\n這時，一位食客雞鳴先生站出來說他會學雞叫。他學得唯妙唯肖，引來附近公雞一起叫，士兵以為天亮了，就開了城門。\n孟嘗君一行人順利出關，逃出秦國。","n":110,"ssz":"...........................................1...................1...........2.....................2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孟嘗君連夜逃到函谷關，但天沒亮，城門不能開。當時規定要聽到雞鳴，士兵才會開門。","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這時，一位食客雞鳴先生站出來說他會學雞叫。他學得唯妙唯肖，引來附近公雞一起叫，士兵以為天亮了，就開了城門。","n":53,"ssz":"...1...................1...........2................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孟嘗君一行人順利出關，逃出秦國。","n":16,"ssz":"...2............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孟嘗君","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"秦昭王","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雞鳴先生","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"被追兵追到","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"天沒亮，城門不能開","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸問題如何「解決」？孟嘗君的食客【　】，引來附近公雞也一起叫，讓士兵以為天亮。","n":39,"ssz":"...........................2..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"模仿雞叫","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"成功出關","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有出關","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎小試身手：","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.課文另一個故事（白狐裘）","n":14,"ssz":"......1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.讓我們來看課文另一個故事","n":14,"ssz":"...........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孟嘗君被秦昭王軟禁，情勢危急。他請幸姬幫忙，幸姬願意救他，但提出條件，要一件白狐裘。可是那件大衣已經送給秦王，孟嘗君無法再拿出一件。\n這時，一位會狗盜的食客站出來。他潛入寶庫，把白狐裘偷了回來。幸姬收到大衣後很高興，便在秦王面前幫孟嘗君說好話。秦王聽了她的話，解除對孟嘗君軟禁。","n":139,"ssz":"......................................................................1...................................1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孟嘗君被秦昭王軟禁，情勢危急。他請幸姬幫忙，幸姬願意救他，但提出條件，要一件白狐裘。可是那件大衣已經送給秦王，孟嘗君無法再拿出一件。","n":66,"ssz":".................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這時，一位會狗盜的食客站出來。他潛入寶庫，把白狐裘偷了回來。幸姬收到大衣後很高興，便在秦王面前幫孟嘗君說好話。秦王聽了她的話，解除對孟嘗君軟禁。","n":72,"ssz":"...1...................................1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"幸姬","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"狗盜先生","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒錢買白狐裘","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"幸姬要白狐裘但已送給秦王","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找不到人幫忙","n":6,"ssz":".1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拜託秦王讓給幸姬","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"再去買一件","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[2].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"食客潛入寶庫偷回白狐裘","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"幸姬幫忙說話，秦王解除軟禁","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"幸姬拒絕幫忙，孟嘗君被關","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"秦王說話不算話，不肯放人","n":12,"ssz":"....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.策略帶著走：大象有多重？","n":14,"ssz":"............1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有一天，吳國送了一頭大象給曹操。大家都很好奇這頭大象到底有多重，可是大象那麼大，放不上秤，沒辦法知道大象的重量。\n這時，年紀還小的曹沖說：「我有辦法！」他請人把大象牽到一艘大船上，等船下沉穩定後，在船身畫一條水位線。然後把大象牽下來，再往船上裝石頭，一邊裝一邊觀察水位，直到水位線回到原來的位置。\n最後，把船上的石頭搬下來一個一個秤重量，就知道大象的重量了。","n":179,"ssz":"........2...........1.........1..........1..........................................2......................................1.2..2............................1....1.1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有一天，吳國送了一頭大象給曹操。大家都很好奇這頭大象到底有多重，可是大象那麼大，放不上秤，沒辦法知道大象的重量。","n":56,"ssz":"........2...........1.........1..........1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這時，年紀還小的曹沖說：「我有辦法！」他請人把大象牽到一艘大船上，等船下沉穩定後，在船身畫一條水位線。然後把大象牽下來，再往船上裝石頭，一邊裝一邊觀察水位，直到水位線回到原來的位置。","n":91,"ssz":"...........................2......................................1.2..2..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].quote#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"最後，把船上的石頭搬下來一個一個秤重量，就知道大象的重量了。","n":30,"ssz":"........1....1.1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2